      "observation": "The second-pass versions of Facts 1-3 (nesting, reachability, white paths) for Visit^R on G^R are claimed 'by the same proofs', with 'unvisited' in place of 'white'. The cost paragraph (241-242) also relies on 'Fact 1 and its analogue'. The first-pass proofs are written out and the substitution is stated, so this audit counts the SCC proof as written. It is recorded because these steps are a transfer by 'the same proofs' rather than written steps for Visit^R."
