      "observation": "The input-class terms 'Horn list' and '2-CNF list' (also at 268, 331 and w02b-p02-015 body line 27) are never defined in a sentence of their own. def:p02-tractable-classes (supplement 307-322) defines Horn for a single clause and 2-CNF for a 'clause set', and says the satisfiability problems 'restrict their inputs to these classes'. def:p02-w02-p02-019-clause-input defines clause lists. This audit accepts the combination as defining the exact input classes, but the compound term is left implicit."
